.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queries the bash\-server session for a listing of shell state objects in
a particular namespace.
Returns a JSON\-formatted string containing an array of entries for the
requested category.
.PP
The function sends an \f[CR]inspect\f[R] request on the STATE channel
(\f[CR]CHAN_STATE\f[R], channel 2) with the given query string.
The server enumerates the requested namespace and returns a JSON array.
